Cell["\<\
SparseTensorNetwork converts tensors in a TN to SparseArray form for memory \
efficiency. but not sure if it is a good name bc only replacing head might \
not help esp since tensors are generated by RandomComplex or RandomReal\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976068817828738*^9, 
